        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠣᠷᠢ ᠣᠯᠠᠳᠠᠵᠤ ᠶᠠᠪᠤᠵᠤ ᠴᠢᠳᠠᠬᠤ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ ᠪᠣᠯᠪᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>mori --zu jabuzu cidaxu ygei bolba</transcript>
          <definition> The horse's feet are so sore that it cannot walk any more</definition>
